Vacaturebeschrijving
   SummaryStart immediately as a Production Worker in Beuningen, earn € 14,99 per hour, and work regular day shifts from 08:00 to 16:45. Are you a hands-on person with strong problem-solving skills and an affinity for technology? Then we are looking for you!
About the jobIn this versatile role, you will be responsible for mixing, filling, labeling, and packaging products. You will operate mixing machines, perform minor maintenance, set up production equipment, and adjust machines during product changeovers. You will report any issues or bottlenecks to your supervisor and work closely with your colleagues to ensure production runs smoothly. Every day brings new challenges and opportunities to demonstrate your technical skills.
What we offer- A salary of € 14,99 per hour;
- Fixed day-shift working hours from 08:00 to 17:45;
- 23 vacation days based on a full-time workweek;
- Opportunity to obtain a forklift certificate free of charge;
- Room for personal development through training courses and education;
- A friendly and informal working environment with activities, outings, and treats.

What we ask- At least 1 year of relevant work experience, preferably in a production and/or waste-processing environment;
- Affinity with technology and technical processes;
- Forklift experience is an advantage;
- Good command of the Dutch or English language.

About the companyThis company is an international collection, processing, and recycling organization specializing primarily in hazardous waste materials. In addition, it produces solvents, paints, and coatings for the professional industry. The company focuses on recycling reusable materials and, together with its sister company, offers a wide range of sustainable products and paints made from recovered raw materials sourced from waste streams. In this way, the company contributes to a more sustainable future through the reuse of valuable resources.
